{"parse": {"title": "TzHaar-Hur", "pageid": 20103, "revid": 15316974, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs}}\n{{HasTask|TzHaar}}\n{{Infobox Monster\n|name = TzHaar-Hur\n|image = [[File:TzHaar-Hur.png|150px]]\n|release = [[19 September]] [[2005]]\n|update = Massive minigame - Fight Pits\n|members = Yes\n|combat = 74\n|size = 1\n|examine = Looks like a craftsman of some kind.\n|xpbonus = 0\n|max hit = 7\n|aggressive = No\n|poisonous = No\n|attack style = [[Crush]]\n|attack speed = 5\n|respawn = 50\n|slayxp = 80\n|cat = TzHaar\n|assignedby = chaeldar,nieve,duradel\n|hitpoints = 80\n|att = 60\n|str = 60\n|def = 60\n|mage = 80\n|range = 1\n|attbns = 0\n|strbns = 0\n|amagic = 0\n|mbns = 0\n|arange = 0\n|rngbns = 0\n|dstab = 0\n|dslash = 0\n|dcrush = 0\n|dmagic = 0\n|dlight = 0\n|dstandard = 0\n|dheavy = 0\n|elementalweaknesstype = Water\n|elementalweaknesspercent = 40\n|poisonresistance = 0\n|venomresistance = 0\n|immunecannon = No\n|immunethrall = No\n|id = 2161,2162,2163,2164,2165,2166,7682,7683,7684,7685,7686,7687\n}}\n[[File:TzHaar-Hur chathead.png|left]]\nThe '''TzHaar-Hur''' are the weakest monsters in [[Mor Ul Rek]]. They are [[TzHaar]] crafters, building the homes and tools of the other TzHaar.{{CiteNPC|npc=TzHaar-Mej-Jal|quote=There are the mighty TzHaar-Ket who guard us, the swift TzHaar-Xil who hunt for our food, and the skilled TzHaar-Hur who craft our homes and tools.|loc=|notes=|name=}}\n\nPlayers who wish to kill them will need to be aware of other TzHaar nearby. Attacking one will cause any nearby [[TzHaar-Ket]], [[TzHaar-Mej (Monster)|TzHaar-Mej]] and [[TzHaar-Xil]] to aid them if they are under attack. Killing them while wearing a charged [[ring of wealth]] increases the drop rate of [[gems]] by 33%.\n\nThe TzHaar-Hur in the inner area of Mor Ul Rek can be pickpocketed, requiring 90 [[Thieving]] and a fire or fire max cape to access the inner area. Pickpocketing them grants some [[Tokkul]] or uncut gems up to diamond and 103.4 experience. If [[ice gloves]] are not worn when pickpocketing the player will take 4 damage, regardless of success; if ice gloves are worn, the player will only take 4 damage upon failure.\n\n==Locations==\n{{LocTableHead}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = TzHaar-Hur\n|location = [[Mor Ul Rek]]\n|levels = 74\n|members = yes\n|mapID = 23\n|plane = 0\n|x:2508,y:5071|x:2452,y:5088|x:2459,y:5093|x:2524,y:5088|x:2525,y:5094|x:2530,y:5097|x:2531,y:5090|x:2533,y:5095|x:2533,y:5103|x:2535,y:5091|x:2540,y:5116|x:2452,y:5123|x:2455,y:5139|x:2458,y:5124|x:2458,y:5126|x:2462,y:5141|x:2469,y:5146|x:2472,y:5143|x:2475,y:5153|x:2479,y:5129|x:2481,y:5137|x:2484,y:5157|x:2485,y:5134|x:2485,y:5140|x:2488,y:5156|x:2491,y:5159|x:2493,y:5155|x:2472,y:5118|x:2477,y:5108|x:2486,y:5103|x:2501,y:5169|x:2502,y:5143|x:2503,y:5162|x:2508,y:5135|x:2510,y:5132|x:2517,y:5129|x:2519,y:5130|x:2526,y:5132|x:2528,y:5145|x:2531,y:5128|x:2509,y:5105|x:2513,y:5112|x:2513,y:5115|x:2516,y:5112|x:2516,y:5115|x:2519,y:5115\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = Karamja\n}}\n{{LocTableBottom}}\n\n==Drops==\n{{DropLogProject|kills=4163}}\n\n===Materials===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Uncut sapphire|quantity=1|rarity=16/2048|altrarity=16/1536|raritynotes=<ref name=row group=d>The drop rate is increased while wearing a [[ring of wealth]] due to some \"nothing\" drops being removed.</ref>}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Uncut emerald|quantity=1|rarity=8/2048|altrarity=8/1536|raritynotes=<ref name=row group=d />}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Uncut ruby|quantity=1|rarity=4/2048|altrarity=4/1536|raritynotes=<ref name=row group=d />}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Uncut diamond|quantity=1|rarity=1/2048|altrarity=1/1536|raritynotes=<ref name=row group=d />}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Other===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Chisel|quantity=1|rarity=8/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Hammer|quantity=1|rarity=8/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Jug|quantity=1|rarity=8/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Knife|quantity=1|rarity=8/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Pot|quantity=1|rarity=8/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Tokkul|quantity=1-16|rarity=64/128|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Nothing|quantity=1|rarity=355/2048|altrarity=259/1536|gemw=No|raritynotes=<ref group=d>Some \"nothing\" drops are removed while wearing a [[ring of wealth]].</ref>}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Pickpocketing==\n===Pickpocket chance===\n{{Skilling success chart|label=TzHaar-Hur pickpocket chance|showbefore=no\n|label1=Normal|low1=-200|high1=200|req1=90|color1=gray|image1=Thieving icon.png\n|label2=Gloves of silence|low2=-210|high2=210|req2=90|color2=darkblue|image2=Gloves of silence.png\n|label3=Ardougne Diary|low3=-220|high3=220|req3=90|color3=black|image3=Ardougne cloak 3.png\n|label4=Thieving cape + Ardougne Diary|low4=-242|high4=242|req4=99|color4=purple|image4=Thieving cape.png\n}}\n\n===Pickpocketing Info===\n{{Thieving info\n|name = TzHaar-Hur\n|level = 90\n|xp = 103.4\n|type = Pickpocket\n|tool = [[Ice gloves]] (highly recommended)\n|timename = [[Stun_(status)#Thieving|Stun]] Timer\n|time = 6s\n|damage = 4\n}}\n\n===Loot===\nA successful pickpocket attempt will gain one of the following items:{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1227768391513100288|date=12 February 2020|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/97034|archivedate=12 February 2020|quote=Assuming I'm reading the right bit of code: 182/195 - Tokkul (3-7), 5/195 - Sapphire, 4/195 - Emerald, 3/195 - Ruby, 1/195 - Diamond}}\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Tokkul|quantity=3-7|rarity=182/195|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Uncut sapphire|quantity=1|rarity=5/195|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Uncut emerald|quantity=1|rarity=4/195|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Uncut ruby|quantity=1|rarity=3/195|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Uncut diamond|quantity=1|rarity=1/195|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill\n|name=Rocky\n|quantity=1\n|skill=thieving\n|rarity=1/174,493\n|altrarity=1/174,268\n|altraritydash=yes\n|raritynotes=\n{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Roq|url=https://twitter.com/JagexRoq/status/877937098858409985|date=22 June 2017|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/105980|archivedate=26 May 2020|quote=Infernal skilling drop rates:\nHeron = 1/160000 - (fishing level*25)\nRocky = 1/176743 - (thieving level*25)}}\n{{Refn|group=d| The drop rate increases with Thieving level; see [[Rocky#Drop_rates|Rocky]] page for more details.}}\n}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Dialogue==\n{{Hastranscript|npc}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 14 January 2026\n|update = New Player Improvements Round 2\n|change = Reverted an efficiency improvement from the previous week's update that caused TzHaar to behave incorrectly in certain scenarios. \n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 2 July 2025\n|update = Stackable Clues are here!\n|change = TzHaar now have a 40% weakness to [[water spells]].}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 1 June 2017\n|type = hotfix\n|change = The experience rates and loot from pickpocketing TzHaar-Hur were decreased.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Wolf|url=https://twitter.com/JagexWolf/status/870299817985150976|date=1 June 2017|archiveurl=https://archive.is/q2sH3|archivedate=28 May 2020|quote=We have further reduced the experience from Tzhaar-Hur by a slight amount, and tinkered with drop rates on their pickpocket drop table.}}\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==Gallery==\n<gallery captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"180\">\nTzHaar-Hur (2).png|A variant of TzHaar-Hur.\nTzHaar-Hur (3).png|A variant of TzHaar-Hur.\nTzHaar-Hur (4).png|A variant of TzHaar-Hur.\nTzHaar-Hur (5).png|A variant of TzHaar-Hur.\nTzHaar-Hur (6).png|A variant of TzHaar-Hur.\n</gallery>\n\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Pickpocket}}\n{{Mor Ul Rek}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:22:40.216540+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header 